    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12220" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cȳrēnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυρήνη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A nymph, mother of Aristæus</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4,
				376</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 354</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 13,
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
