				14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A fountain in Thessaly</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. G. 4, 354</span></i>.</div>
